The shared optional HTTP backends depend on webpki-root-certs 1.0.9, which distributes
Mozilla root certificate data under CDLA-Permissive-2.0. Its license text is
included at LICENSES/CDLA-Permissive-2.0.txt.

The optional Bitcoin primitives depend on hex_lit 0.1.1 by Martin Habovstiak,
as attributed in its released package metadata. The package declares MITNFA:
https://spdx.org/licenses/MITNFA.html. LICENSES/MITNFA.txt retains the canonical
SPDX license text; the released hex_lit archive has no standalone license file.
No upstream source modifications are vendored here. Substantial modifications
described by MITNFA must retain responsibility for their own bug-reporting contacts.

The optional Cardano primitives use minicbor 0.26.5 and minicbor-derive 0.16.2
through pallas-codec 1.4.0. Both packages declare BlueOak-1.0.0:
https://blueoakcouncil.org/license/1.0.0. Their identical released license text
is retained at LICENSES/BlueOak-1.0.0.md.
